el, South Buyers Club. Sometime afterwards, the label was renamed to The South. Under the label, Nam debuted the band South Club, of which he is leader, main vocalist, guitarist, and main composer. As of 2024, he transitioned into a solo artist, with his returning single 'On the Edge of the Night.'","title":"Nam Tae-hyun","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nam_Tae-hyun"}},"Q16097542":{"id":"Q16097542","name":"Byung-heon","ko":"병헌","birthName":"이병헌","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["L.Joe","Byung-hun","Lee Byung-hun"],"birth":"1993-11-23","death":"","birthplace":"Gunsan","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor"],"debut":"2010","agencies":[{"name":"TOP Media","korean":true,"id":"Q11233843","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q307368","name":"Teen Top","start":"2010","end":"2017"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/byunghun_1123/","x":"https://x.com/iam_byunghun","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/4415064d-a9ea-4cef-8a32-98cf8eecce19"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/181024_%EB%B3%91%ED%97%8C.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:181024_%EB%B3%91%ED%97%8C.jpg","author":"뉴스인스타","license":"CC BY 3.0"},"bio":{"text":"Lee Byung-hun, known mononymously as Byung Hun, is a South Korean actor and singer. He debuted as a member of the South Korean boy band Teen Top in 2010 under the stage name L.Joe and left in 2017 until he nullified his contract with TOP Media.","title":"Byung Hun (entertainer)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byung_Hun_%28entertainer%29"},"mbti":"ISFP","factSources":{"mbti":{"name":"Namu Wiki (2021 dump)","license":"CC BY-NC-SA 2.0 KR","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/2.0/kr/","base":"https://namu.wiki/w/","url":"https://namu.wiki/w/%EB%B3%91%ED%97%8C"}}},"Q16240326":{"id":"Q16240326","name":"Bea Miller","ko":"비 밀러","birthName":"Bea